{'symbol': 'TYL', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'City of Boerne, Texas, Extends Community Engagement Efforts with Tyler Technologies’ MyCivic Application', 'text': 'Tyler Technologies Inc. announced the city of Boerne, Texas, has successfully gone live with Tyler’s MyCivic™ citizen engagement application. Utilizing a rapid-deployment model, the city was live on MyCivic in less than three months. After deciding what features the city wanted to include in the application, Tyler and the city worked together to develop and finalize the content in an easy-to-use layout. The app is available for download at no cost from the Apple®App Store and the Google®Play Store. The city of Boerne selected Tyler’s MyCivic application to provide a better citizen engagement tool for its community via a public-facing mobile app. Since the launch on July 27, a total of 321 devices have downloaded the app, and the app has been opened about 1,500 times.'}
