{'symbol': 'WLTW', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'Lifescan Engages with Willis Towers Watson to Expand Access to Onetouch Reveal® Plus', 'text': "LifeScan announced a new engagement with Willis Towers Watson to expand the adoption of OneTouch Reveal® Plus, the digital diabetes therapeutic powered by Welldoc's BlueStar® platform. Through this collaboration, the companies will seek to support self-insured employers help their employees and dependents manage their diabetes in an effort to improve outcomes and reduce treatment costs. This partnership will also include a new subscription test strip bundle option for patients. Currently, OneTouch Reveal® Plus is indicated for use with adult patients with type 2 diabetes. LifeScan and Welldoc are working to expand the app's digital capabilities and connectivity with the goal of pursuing FDA clearance to include type 1 diabetes and, potentially, other conditions."}
{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2019-10-01 08:30:00', 'title': "Xcel Energy Inc Says MPUC Voted To Deny NSP-Minnesota's Request To Purchase MEC", 'text': "XCEL ENERGY INC -  ON SEPT. 27, MPUC VOTED TO DENY NSP-MINNESOTA'S REQUEST TO PURCHASE MEC.XCEL ENERGY -MPUC DETERMINED THERE WAS UNCERTAINTY ON ESTIMATED CUSTOMER BENEFITS RELATED TO MEC DEAL WITHOUT REVIEWING NSP-MINNESOTA'S RESOURCE PLAN.XCEL ENERGY INC - ANNOUNCED INTENTION TO FORM A NEW SUBSIDIARY AND ACQUIRE EXISTING MEC ENTITIES AS A NON-RATE REGULATED INVESTMENT.XCEL ENERGY INC - TO ACQUIRE EXISTING MEC ENTITIES UNDER SAME PURCHASE AGREEMENT WITH SOUTHERN POWER COMPANY.XCEL ENERGY INC - UNIT WOULD ASSUME EXISTING PURCHASE POWER AGREEMENTS AND CONTINUE TO SELL POWER TO NSP-MINNESOTA THROUGH 2026 AND 2039.XCEL ENERGY INC - MPUC'S DECISION IS NOT EXPECTED TO HAVE A MATERIAL IMPACT ON 2019 RESULTS.XCEL ENERGY INC - REAFFIRMS 2019 GUIDANCE OF $2.55 TO $2.65 PER SHARE, EXPECTS TO BE AT OR ABOVE MIDPOINT OF GUIDANCE RANGE."}
